WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.200
The blue crank turns; the purple rocker swings.

2
00:00:03.926 --> 00:00:06.551
Four bars, joined at four pivots.

3
00:00:11.539 --> 00:00:14.564
The crank turns all the way; the rocker swings.

4
00:00:15.516 --> 00:00:18.191
The lengths decide whether the crank can turn.
